{"id":"c27","stage":4,"title":"教育机会","scene":"区分个人努力和结构条件。","roles":["敏智","你"],"lines":[{"id":"c27-1","ko":"교육 격차를 개인의 노력만으로 설명할 수 있을까요?","zh":"教育差距能只用个人努力来解释吗？","note":"以疑问提出讨论问题。","words":[{"term":"교육","zh":"教育","id":"4da9a75910ede3ad","audio":"/audio/4da9a75910ede3adef01.mp3"},{"term":"격차","zh":"差距","id":"00215bdb907dd123","audio":"/audio/00215bdb907dd123ba7d.mp3"},{"term":"설명하다","zh":"解释","id":"c82e2f4887d4be70","audio":"/audio/c82e2f4887d4be700a38.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/3051c89200207db1b9b3.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"교육","meaning":"教育","explanation":"교육修饰격차。","readings":[{"term":"교육","audio":"/audio/4da9a75910ede3adef01.mp3"},{"term":"격차","audio":"/audio/00215bdb907dd123ba7d.mp3"}]},{"text":"격차를","meaning":"差距","explanation":"격차（差距）+ 를（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"격차","audio":"/audio/00215bdb907dd123ba7d.mp3"}]},{"text":"개인의","meaning":"个人的","explanation":"개인（个人）+ 의（修饰关系）。","readings":[{"term":"개인의","audio":"/audio/4f96cbf79f63ea308b5f.mp3"}]},{"text":"노력만으로","meaning":"仅凭努力","explanation":"노력（努力）+ 만（仅）+ 으로（手段、依据）。","readings":[{"term":"노력만으로","audio":"/audio/612d31090420a64bd1db.mp3"}]},{"text":"설명할","meaning":"解释","explanation":"설명하다（解释）+ -ㄹ，修饰수。","readings":[{"term":"설명하다","audio":"/audio/c82e2f4887d4be700a38.mp3"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可能","explanation":"수与있다组成“能够”。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}]},{"text":"있을까요?","meaning":"能吗？","explanation":"있다 + -을까요（委婉疑问）。","readings":[{"term":"있을까요","audio":"/audio/ef6f1745d773e6085ac3.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c27-2","ko":"가정 환경과 지역의 자원도 영향을 미쳐요.","zh":"家庭环境和地区资源也会产生影响。","note":"영향을 미치다：产生影响。","words":[{"term":"가정","zh":"家庭","id":"4b987d4b6a865acd","audio":"/audio/4b987d4b6a865acd1c42.mp3"},{"term":"지역","zh":"地区","id":"770eb9e292c17199","audio":"/audio/770eb9e292c171999d24.mp3"},{"term":"자원","zh":"资源","id":"df4ee15a028f0dc8","audio":"/audio/df4ee15a028f0dc884b2.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/1497edffd46af52a5ee4.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"가정","meaning":"家庭","explanation":"가정修饰환경。","readings":[{"term":"가정","audio":"/audio/4b987d4b6a865acd1c42.mp3"}]},{"text":"환경과","meaning":"环境和","explanation":"환경（环境）+ 과（和）。","readings":[{"term":"환경과","audio":"/audio/fe4b10cdbe0e95f29bb8.mp3"}]},{"text":"지역의","meaning":"地区的","explanation":"지역（地区）+ 의（修饰关系）。","readings":[{"term":"지역","audio":"/audio/770eb9e292c171999d24.mp3"}]},{"text":"자원도","meaning":"资源也","explanation":"자원（资源）+ 도（也）。","readings":[{"term":"자원","audio":"/audio/df4ee15a028f0dc884b2.mp3"}]},{"text":"영향을","meaning":"影响","explanation":"영향（影响）+ 을（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"영향을","audio":"/audio/a069591875d05a4a48dc.mp3"}]},{"text":"미쳐요.","meaning":"产生","explanation":"미치다（及、造成）→ 미쳐요；영향을 미치다为“产生影响”。","readings":[{"term":"미쳐요","audio":"/audio/7649b749b42ae7cb672b.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c27-3","ko":"온라인 수업이 대안이 될 수 있지 않을까요?","zh":"在线课程能否成为一种替代方案？","note":"대안 指替代或解决方案。","words":[{"term":"온라인","zh":"在线","id":"cf9ef5f1ef01d87a","audio":"/audio/cf9ef5f1ef01d87a94a1.mp3"},{"term":"대안","zh":"替代方案","id":"10f0209f371a19c5","audio":"/audio/10f0209f371a19c52da2.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/f2d8b05e7b1367c9fbf0.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"온라인","meaning":"在线","explanation":"온라인修饰수업。","readings":[{"term":"온라인","audio":"/audio/cf9ef5f1ef01d87a94a1.mp3"}]},{"text":"수업이","meaning":"课程","explanation":"수업（课）+ 이（主格）。","readings":[{"term":"수업이","audio":"/audio/c932de5b31ba0297918b.mp3"}]},{"text":"대안이","meaning":"替代方案","explanation":"대안（替代、解决方案）+ 이（되다前标示成为的结果）。","readings":[{"term":"대안","audio":"/audio/10f0209f371a19c52da2.mp3"}]},{"text":"될","meaning":"成为","explanation":"되다（成为）+ -ㄹ，修饰수。","readings":[{"term":"될","audio":"/audio/dc84eeabbbd47f74f20a.mp3"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可能","explanation":"수与있다组成“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}]},{"text":"있지","meaning":"可以","explanation":"있다 + -지，与않다组成否定疑问。","readings":[{"term":"있지","audio":"/audio/6af127780f763fcd960b.mp3"}]},{"text":"않을까요?","meaning":"不可以吗？","explanation":"않다 + -을까요；-ㄹ 수 있지 않을까요委婉提出可能方案。","readings":[{"term":"않을까요","audio":"/audio/ef645ed401b3e6751b53.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c27-4","ko":"접근성을 높일 수 있지만 기기와 학습 지원이 필요해요.","zh":"它能提高可及性，但也需要设备和学习支持。","note":"접근성：获得或使用某事物的便利程度。","words":[{"term":"접근성","zh":"可及性","id":"970823c08f6e9883","audio":"/audio/970823c08f6e9883752b.mp3"},{"term":"기기","zh":"设备","id":"e3299f2d5feda0f1","audio":"/audio/e3299f2d5feda0f12b15.mp3"},{"term":"지원","zh":"支持","id":"0e7cfc63937a1417","audio":"/audio/0e7cfc63937a14176353.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/038e738de2634950c897.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"접근성을","meaning":"可及性","explanation":"접근성（获得或使用的便利程度）+ 을（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"접근성","audio":"/audio/970823c08f6e9883752b.mp3"}]},{"text":"높일","meaning":"提高","explanation":"높이다（提高）+ -ㄹ，修饰수。","readings":[{"term":"높일","audio":"/audio/fe8b08afaafec1d8e499.mp3"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可能","explanation":"수与있다组成“能”。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}]},{"text":"있지만","meaning":"能，但","explanation":"있다 + -지만（转折）。","readings":[{"term":"있지만","audio":"/audio/68f1b82486ee5c54427e.mp3"}]},{"text":"기기와","meaning":"设备和","explanation":"기기（设备）+ 와（和）。","readings":[{"term":"기기","audio":"/audio/e3299f2d5feda0f12b15.mp3"}]},{"text":"학습","meaning":"学习","explanation":"학습修饰지원。","readings":[{"term":"지원","audio":"/audio/0e7cfc63937a14176353.mp3"}]},{"text":"지원이","meaning":"支持","explanation":"지원（支持）+ 이（主格）。","readings":[{"term":"지원","audio":"/audio/0e7cfc63937a14176353.mp3"}]},{"text":"필요해요.","meaning":"有必要","explanation":"필요하다的礼貌形式。","readings":[{"term":"필요해요","audio":"/audio/67e74520ce9a35e80201.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c27-5","ko":"같은 기회를 주는 것과 같은 결과를 보장하는 건 다르군요.","zh":"提供相同机会和保证相同结果，确实不一样。","note":"-군요 表示新认识或领悟。","words":[{"term":"결과","zh":"结果","id":"109383e344db8ae5","audio":"/audio/109383e344db8ae54a47.mp3"},{"term":"보장하다","zh":"保障","id":"0d89f358c44ea763","audio":"/audio/0d89f358c44ea7637127.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/c3537049e865c4122545.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"같은","meaning":"同样的","explanation":"같다（相同）+ -은（定语形）。","readings":[{"term":"같은","audio":"/audio/9dce73570f65f8a11961.mp3"}]},{"text":"기회를","meaning":"机会","explanation":"기회（机会）+ 를（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"기회를","audio":"/audio/ba41e46d6c114f2b02f2.mp3"}]},{"text":"주는","meaning":"给予的","explanation":"주다（给）+ -는（定语形）。","readings":[{"term":"주는","audio":"/audio/f2dcf42e42a4682a9877.mp3"}]},{"text":"것과","meaning":"这件事和","explanation":"것（事）+ 과（和），将给予机会这一行为名词化。","readings":[{"term":"것과","audio":"/audio/b116f73e855b20a5bd1c.mp3"}]},{"text":"같은","meaning":"同样的","explanation":"같다的定语形式，修饰결과。","readings":[{"term":"결과","audio":"/audio/109383e344db8ae54a47.mp3"}]},{"text":"결과를","meaning":"结果","explanation":"결과（结果）+ 를（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"결과","audio":"/audio/109383e344db8ae54a47.mp3"}]},{"text":"보장하는","meaning":"保证的","explanation":"보장하다（保证）+ -는（定语形）。","readings":[{"term":"보장하다","audio":"/audio/0d89f358c44ea7637127.mp3"}]},{"text":"건","meaning":"这件事","explanation":"것은的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"건","audio":"/audio/f5fd44f22ad30ad631dc.mp3"}]},{"text":"다르군요.","meaning":"确实不同呢","explanation":"다르다（不同）+ -군요（新认识、领悟）。","readings":[{"term":"다르군요","audio":"/audio/536a7a1855ef2d4e18b4.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c27-6","ko":"네, 출발점의 차이를 줄이는 방향으로 접근해야 해요.","zh":"对，应从缩小起点差异的方向着手。","note":"방향으로 접근하다：从某个方向处理。","words":[{"term":"출발점","zh":"起点","id":"c66cba09ce04d1f4","audio":"/audio/c66cba09ce04d1f434f1.mp3"},{"term":"차이","zh":"差异","id":"b9b47d9dee081fde","audio":"/audio/b9b47d9dee081fdee3de.mp3"},{"term":"접근하다","zh":"着手处理","id":"a719c6606fe27d77","audio":"/audio/a719c6606fe27d77797d.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/8f4a0158f01fd7c363c1.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"对","explanation":"네表示赞同。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}]},{"text":"출발점의","meaning":"起点的","explanation":"출발점（起点）+ 의（修饰关系）。","readings":[{"term":"출발점","audio":"/audio/c66cba09ce04d1f434f1.mp3"}]},{"text":"차이를","meaning":"差异","explanation":"차이（差异）+ 를（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"차이","audio":"/audio/b9b47d9dee081fdee3de.mp3"}]},{"text":"줄이는","meaning":"缩小的","explanation":"줄이다（减少）+ -는（定语形）。","readings":[{"term":"줄이는","audio":"/audio/7b523c8a2c25bac3cddf.mp3"}]},{"text":"방향으로","meaning":"从方向","explanation":"방향（方向）+ 으로（方向、方法）。","readings":[{"term":"방향으로","audio":"/audio/42441f48ea68b4dda8f2.mp3"}]},{"text":"접근해야","meaning":"需要着手","explanation":"접근하다（接近、着手处理）+ -아/어야（必须）。","readings":[{"term":"접근하다","audio":"/audio/a719c6606fe27d77797d.mp3"}]},{"text":"해요.","meaning":"应该","explanation":"하다的礼貌形式，与前文构成必要性表达。","readings":[{"term":"해요","audio":"/audio/521029965a4dd3b2882e.mp3"}]}]}],"day":131,"sequenceScore":2.76,"questions":[{"lineIndex":2,"options":["在线课程能否成为一种替代方案？","在线课程是否应该被全面取消？","线下课程能否成为唯一选择？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":4,"options":["提供相同机会就能保证相同结果。","提供相同机会和保证相同结果，确实不一样。","相同机会和相同结果都无法提供。"],"answer":1}]}
